{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_05_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_05",
  "title": "各有所长",
  "storyCode": "RI-5",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0db9a33623b86b446e15789283bed24eac44072366f3f55a112f044cc7546562",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你怎么会带着这群阿达克利斯来袭击的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，我只是看到这里有个村庄，就想着打群架应该挺好玩的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......该说不愧是你吗，一旦涉及到战斗，就完全变了个人呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜呜，对不起啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，你这家伙到底是怎么做到语言不通还能使唤这群家伙的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "关于这个，其实我也不是很清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungleentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我的美甲被刮到了，好烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "美甲套装在掉下来的时候也不知道飞哪儿去了，好烦乘二。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打架出了好多汗，这里的空气又这么潮，衣服都湿透了，好烦乘三。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且我明明只是在这里走路，为什么不停地有阿达克利斯来和我打架啊，好烦乘四。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，说到底，一开始是说这里是个度假的好地方我才来的，但是这里哪里像度假胜地啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？有人在悄悄靠近我？那些人是......阿达克利斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后，我就把靠近我的那些人全都打了一顿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "后来，又有更多的人来，我就又把他们打了一顿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打到最后，他们不知道为什么就对我毕恭毕敬的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，我懂了，他们可能把你当成新奇的动物了，毕竟我们这里没有长你这样的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？！我这样青春可爱的美少女哪里像动物了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，老实说，从阿达克利斯的角度来看，你可能确实像个怪胎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且我看到跟随你的这群人里，有巨木部族的族长，问了他一下，他说，现在你才是巨木部族的族长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是说，你把一支部族的族长打败了，他们认为你是新的族长，所以才会跟着你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶？他们明明听不懂我说话，这也行？！我还以为他们只是好玩才跟着我的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这里，你只要够强大，就可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可怎么办啊，博士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你自己解决。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "宴",
              "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "呜呜呜，博士好绝情！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "宴",
              "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "呜呜，博士不要用那种眼神看我嘛。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "宴",
              "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我又不是故意的......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "不如你就留在这里当族长好了。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "宴",
              "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "诶，我才不要！我才不要过没电视没空调的生活！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，至少找到了你和可颂，现在就剩下煌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌大姐应该不会有事吧，想象不出她出事的样子诶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。对了，博士，接下来我们要去干什么，去神庙参加嘉维尔说的祭典吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，对，忘了你们不知道，博士，你来解释一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "向宴和可颂解释了一下现状。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯，原来如此，所以我们现在是要去找那个叫祖玛玛的人要回引擎对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶？祭典就这么结束了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我不是白来了吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，反正听起来就是那种我不会很感兴趣的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起这个，嘉维尔，说好的这里适合度假呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？你不觉得这里环境很好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然，确实，是这样，没错！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，这里一点也没有度假的要素啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "度假的要素是什么样的啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然是，海边，沙滩，阳伞，冰淇淋啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了这个，我还特地准备了新的泳装，而且出发前就穿在衣服下面了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶，我倒是单纯地没有什么事做就跟来看看了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我一开始就没说过有这种东西吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是说可以玩水的吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那确实有啊，雨林深处有一座大瀑布，我们可以在那里玩水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且为了去祖玛玛的部族，我们肯定要经过大瀑布。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别说你，我也带了泳装呢，只不过我没拿出来而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的吗，好耶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起来人找到了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多亏了你啊，依娜姆，谢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦对了，特米米那孩子呢，不是应该跟你们在一起吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道，她好像有自己的事，之后会跟她汇合吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，那麻烦你们把这些书带给她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我看看，《都市丽人》，《100天教你如何学会企业管理》，《如何成为一个时尚专家》......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这都什么奇奇怪怪的书啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她就是靠这些书学的萨尔贡语和对外界的知识的，啊，当然基础是我教她的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，靠这些学会萨尔贡语应该很难吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。但她就是这么学下来了，一个字一个字，一个词一个词。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实，比起学习的艰难，一开始她那种不知道自己该怎么做而焦急的样子才让人看着都难受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是因为这个才决定教她萨尔贡语的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔，她为了追上你，可是非常努力的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不用你说我也知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，我自己对外界也没有那么了解，而且我每次能带的书也就那么一点，所以我也不确定她从这些书上学到的东西到底有没有用，啊哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......难怪我觉得她好像有点怪怪的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，祖玛玛的萨尔贡语难道也是你教的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是。其实这一点我也挺好奇的，她虽然也有让我帮她找机械相关的书籍，但就好像突然学会了萨尔贡语。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且她还在教部族里的人学。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士，你怎么看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "野心不小啊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "果然博士也这么想吗......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "你的意思是让我自己去想吗？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嘿，好吧，那我就用自己的做法来解决问题。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "这块石头怎么卖？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "依娜姆",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "看在你是新顾客的份上，收你300萨尔贡币好了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "宴",
              "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士一副完全无所谓的样子耶。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶，但我觉得教萨尔贡语不是坏事啊，能够和外界交流的话，这里的人也能过上更好的生活吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许吧，我是觉得即使不过上所谓更好的生活，这里的生活也已经足够了就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然你们生活在城市里的人大概没有办法理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我多少能理解一点！毕竟我在东国的老家也是乡下呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶，我还以为宴你这么懂潮流，肯定是都市长大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有没有，我只是对这方面比较感兴趣而已啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼啊，我好困，睡午觉去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这个部族里，摆在外面的都是拿出来交易的，看中什么就让嘉维尔帮忙翻译一下就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "等等。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
